#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:114
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The translation of **Zammad** and the translation of the **documentation**\n"
"are split into two projects in Weblate. When you click in the top menu "
"under\n"
"\"*Projects > Browse all projects*\", you can find the overview of the two\n"
"projects:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/contribute/contribute.md:116
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"![Screenshot showing translation projects in Weblate and "
"menu](/screenshots/weblate-overview-docs.png)"
msgstr ""

