#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/cti.md:62
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"There are several events in terms of an ongoing call. These actions always "
"come from your PBX system and may be:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/cti.md:66
#, markdown-text
