"\n"
"=== Request\n"
"\n"
"```json\n"
"{\n"
"   \"link_type\": \"normal\",\n"
"   \"link_object_target\": \"Ticket\",\n"
"   \"link_object_target_value\": 11,\n"
"   \"link_object_source\": \"Ticket\",\n"
"   \"link_object_source_number\": \"93010\"\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
