"most situations, except if you're looking at the default object\n"
"permissions. This is why we're listing these separate for you to view.\n"
"\n"
"The attribute `object` controls which context is being used:\n"
"\n"
"- `Ticket`\n"
"- `User`\n"
"- `Organisation`\n"
